    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know. i know i should talk to someone. it's just... it's hard to explain it to a person. they'll just try to fix me or tell me i'm being dramatic. but it feels so inevitable. it's like watching a candle burn down to nothing. there’s no point in trying to hold onto a shadow, you know? eventually, the darkness is just easier than fighting to keep the lights on when they're already flickering out.",
